Third try was the scariest:

Kenzo left a bones pile with several dangers. Think about an archon,
a small army of djinnis, and a (newly created) bull roaming down there.
Just about there, I was fed up with wizards, so I tried an archaeologist
instead. I first studied carefully the weapon and skill spoilers to figure
out which class would be the best for two-weaponing uzis and still
