He wore Kenzo's stuff, ended up with Thiefbane and some other sword,
I think it was Grayswandir. Converted to neutral (wished for a white
unicorn corpse), so that the Eye could be used.

Carefully collected the bullets from the castle and the fort, and spent
some > 1000 rounds, all +7, at the astral plane. With two +7 uzis,
nothing really scared him, so I think this was one of the easiest trips
I've made there. Also lots of fun. I don't have the record
